			</layout>
                            </layoutDesc>
                        </objectDesc>
                        <handDesc>
                            <handNote><p>Large, reasonably wide module, v-cut letters, very regular, with simple and consistent standard serifs; tear-drop shaped interpuncts. The letters bear paint, brown/red in colour, unclear if original or modern.</p>
